{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","狂狼袭咬"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","狂狼の牙"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","变身为狼，获得更强的作战能力。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","ウルフに変身すると、より高い戦闘能力を獲得できる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","沙奎尔变身为“狼形态”并扑向1个地图格，击飞处于该格的敌军并对周围2格范围内的敌人造成190% ATK伤害，释放期间处于霸体状态。沙奎尔每秒需要消耗60点能量来维持“狼形态”。处于“狼形态”时，沙奎尔生成2格范围的“狂狼光环”，并且普通攻击会对面前1格扇形区域内的所有敌军造成伤害。处于“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低20% + 2%，提升10 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「ウルフ形態」に変身し、1つのマスに飛びかかり、そのマスにいる敵を打ち上げ、周囲2マス内の敵に190% ATKのダメージを与える。スキル発動中、スーパーアーマー状態になる。「ウルフ形態」を維持するために、毎秒60のSPを消費する。「ウルフ形態」の間、半径2マス範囲の「狂狼のオーラ」を展開し、通常攻撃は前方1マスの扇状範囲内の敵全体にダメージを与えるようになる。「狂狼のオーラ」範囲内の味方の被ダメージ-20% + 2%、速度+10 + 3"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":163,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":173,"end":177,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":205,"end":210,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":216,"end":220,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":72,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低20% + 2%，提升15 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「狂狼のオーラ」範囲内の味方は被ダメージ-20% + 2%、速度+15 + 3"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":35,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升15 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「狂狼のオーラ」範囲内の味方は被ダメージ-25% + 2%、速度+15 + 3"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":35,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升20 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「狂狼のオーラ」範囲内の味方は被ダメージ-25% + 2%、速度+20 + 3"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":35,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“狂狼光环”内的友军受到的伤害降低25% + 2%，提升25 + 3点急速。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","「狂狼のオーラ」範囲内の味方は被ダメージ-25% + 2%、速度+25 + 3"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":30,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":35,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","烈爪锋刃"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","鋭い爪刃"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续发动3次攻击，狼形态下能够造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵を連続で3回攻撃。「ウルフ形態」の場合、範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","连续攻击目标3次，前2次攻击造成90% + 10% ATK伤害，第3次攻击造成160% + 20%伤害。处于“狼形态”时，技能范围变为前方1格扇形区域。"],["/skills/